      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Nestled between Mission Hills, Balboa Park, and North Park, Hillcrest is San Diego’s glitteriest neighborhood and the anchor of its Pride festivals and LGBTQ history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
