      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Hillcrest Nature Reserve, established in the early 20th century, preserves diverse plant life, vibrant wildlife, and offers trails for runners, walkers, and hikers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/top-10-places-to-visit-in-hillcrest-nature-adventure-and-history/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hillcrest Village Centre embodies the cultural diversity and lively atmosphere of the neighborhood, making it a popular destination for locals.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
